<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E revises up 97 group net view.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E revises up 97 group net view.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading company Mostostal Export SA expects to make a group net profit of 57 million zlotys this year on 750 million zlotys in sales, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Mostostal had previously expected a group net of 53 million zlotys on 670 million zlotys in sales. Last year Mostostal Export made a group net profit of 43 million zlotys on 495 million zlotys in sales.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
